    content: "This site marks the grave of Kombo wa Mūnyῑrῑ, a powerful Paramount Chief who ruled Mavuria in Mbeere during the colonial days. Kombo was famed for having 40 wives and very many children, and thus he had many homes. Kombo was buried near Kiamukuyu Primary school, close to Iriamurarai Secondary School, Mbeere South. There is a stone marking the grave. His father, Mūnyῑrῑ, was the first paramount Chief of Mbeere under colonial rule. Mūnyῑrῑ had lived at Mari-Iguru, a village near Kiritiri.",
